  letterTitle: Chief's Letter
  pages:
  - "If the Chief asks, tell him I\u2019m on walk patrol. Keep the line steady. Hold
    the gate like I showed you. Don\u2019t get clever, don\u2019t get curious. It'll
    take a while, Foxy\u2019s called me up to the rock at the nightwatch. She better
    have her booze'm ready when I get there."
